{%- comment -%}
  AJ Email Popup — the capture that interrupts.

  A SNIPPET, NOT A SECTION, AND THAT IS THE FIX. As a static section in the
  layout this rendered nothing at all, three ways: a section never opened in the
  theme editor has no stored settings, Shopify does not fall back to schema
  defaults for those, and Liquid evaluates `nil == false` as TRUE — so `if
  enabled`, `if enabled != false`, and everything in between produced an empty
  wrapper. A snippet has no settings layer to be nil, so it simply renders.

  The cost is that the copy lives in this file rather than the theme editor.
  Worth it: the copy changes rarely, and a popup nobody can see is worth nothing
  however configurable it is.

  IT EARNS ITS INTERRUPTION OR IT DOES NOT APPEAR — the suppression rules live in
  aj-email-popup.js and matter more than anything here:
    never on the join page, never after a signup, never inside the dismissal
    window, never before the delay, and never at all without localStorage to
    keep those promises with.

  THE OFFER IS ACCESS, NOT A DISCOUNT. The Yoink is clamped near cost and the
  bin runs at a 20% floor, so another discount comes out of a $12.67
  contribution. Early access costs nothing.

  AND IT PROMISES NO CADENCE. This said "one email a day", which committed the
  business to a send frequency nobody had decided on — and an unkept promise made
  at the moment someone hands over their address is the most expensive kind.
  "When something's worth your time" is true whatever the schedule turns out to
  be, and it can tighten later once a real cadence exists. Never loosen a promise
  after making it; only ever make one you already keep.
{%- endcomment -%}
<aj-email-popup
    class="aj-pop"
    hidden
    {%- comment -%}
      10s, down from 12. The floor on this number is the Yoink: the deal is what
      a visitor should see first, and it takes a few seconds to read a product,
      a price, a saving and a countdown. Ten still clears that; much under it and
      the popup lands on someone mid-sentence, which is how a capture teaches
      people to close things without reading them.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    data-delay="10"
    data-remember-days="30"
    data-exit-intent="true"
  >
    <div class="aj-pop__backdrop" data-close></div>

    <div class="aj-pop__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="aj-pop-title">
      <button class="aj-pop__x" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

      <div data-state="form">
        <h2 class="aj-pop__title" id="aj-pop-title">Get first look at the good stuff</h2>
        
          <p class="aj-pop__sub">A new deal every morning, plus a Bargain Bin that rotates weekly. We&#39;ll make sure you hear about the ones worth your time.</p>
        

        {%- form 'customer', class: 'aj-pop__form' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="popup">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="aj-pop-email">Email address</label>
          <input
            id="aj-pop-email"
            class="aj-pop__input"
            type="email"
            name="contact[email]"
            placeholder="you@example.com"
            autocomplete="email"
            required
          >
          <button class="aj-pop__submit" type="submit">Count me in</button>
          
            <p class="aj-pop__fine">No spam, no daily pestering. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
          
        {%- endform -%}

        <button class="aj-pop__decline" type="button" data-close>
          No thanks
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aj-email-popup>

  <script src="{{ 'aj-email-popup.js' | asset_url }}" type="module" fetchpriority="low"></script>

<style>
  .aj-pop { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1000; display: block; }
  .aj-pop[hidden] { display: none; }

  .aj-pop__backdrop {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5);
    animation: aj-pop-fade 0.25s ease;
  }

  .aj-pop__panel {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: min(30rem, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgb(var(--color-background-rgb, 255 255 255));
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17));
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.28);
    animation: aj-pop-rise 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.3, 1);
  }

  @keyframes aj-pop-fade { from { opacity: 0 } to { opacity: 1 } }
  @keyframes aj-pop-rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% + 12px)); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aj-pop__backdrop, .aj-pop__panel { animation: none; }
  }

  .aj-pop__x {
    position: absolute; top: 0.5rem; right: 0.75rem;
    background: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1; opacity: 0.5;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .aj-pop__x:hover { opacity: 1; }

  .aj-pop__title { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .aj-pop__sub { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; opacity: 0.75; }

  .aj-pop__form { display: grid; gap: 0.7rem; }

  .aj-pop__input {
    box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem; font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.25);
    background: rgb(var(--color-background-rgb, 255 255 255));
    color: inherit;
  }

  .aj-pop__submit {
    padding: 0.95rem 1rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;
    border: 0; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb)); color: rgb(var(--color-background-rgb, 255 255 255));
  }
  .aj-pop__submit:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

  .aj-pop__fine { margin: 0; font-size: 0.78rem; opacity: 0.6; }

  /* A plain, low-contrast decline rather than a guilt-tripped "no thanks, I hate
     savings". Dark patterns buy one signup and cost the brand. */
  .aj-pop__decline {
    margin-top: 0.9rem; width: 100%;
    background: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.55; color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .aj-pop__decline:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
</style>
